From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: QED64 Toolchain <qed64-toolchain@localhost>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 15:41:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 01/17] build: add the Emscripten 6.0.5 wasm64 Docker build
 recipe
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A pinned, containerized build environment for the wasm64 (Memory64) target:
the emscripten/emsdk:6.0.5-arm64 image (use the amd64 tag or a multi-arch
digest pin on x86-64 CI; tags are mutable — pin by digest for releases) plus
two configure contracts:

* configure.sh — the spike's original values (12 GiB declared maximum,
  CHECK_OLEAN_VERSION=ON), kept for provenance;
* configure-qed64.sh — the release configuration: 16 GiB declared maximum
  (wasm import matching requires every embedder-provided memory maximum to
  be <= the module's declared maximum, and shipped workers probe up to
  8-16 GiB), and CHECK_OLEAN_VERSION=OFF (the strict gate is a 40-byte
  strncmp of each olean's producer githash against the loading binary's
  LEAN_GITHASH in lean_compacted_region_read; artifact packs produced by a
  different commit of the same source lineage would all be rejected with it
  ON — pack trust is enforced at the SHA-256 manifest layer instead; note
  the loader still enforces the format version and GMP flag byte, so a
  GMP-enabled producer's packs remain unloadable regardless).

Container note: run `git config --global --add safe.directory /lean4` before
configuring, or git fails on the bind mount and stage0 embeds an EMPTY
githash (observed; violates release gate 5).

Native stage0 needs host libuv/OpenSSL headers; the wasm stage builds its
own patched libuv through Emscripten.

Upstreaming: replaces the historical i386-stage0 recipe (the wasm32 build's
pointer-width shim); with an LP64 target, stage0 is an ordinary native build
and the exotic 32-bit toolchain requirements disappear.
---
 docker-wasm64/Dockerfile         | 12 ++++++++++++
 docker-wasm64/configure-qed64.sh | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 docker-wasm64/configure.sh       | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 63 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 docker-wasm64/Dockerfile
 create mode 100755 docker-wasm64/configure-qed64.sh
 create mode 100755 docker-wasm64/configure.sh

diff --git a/docker-wasm64/Dockerfile b/docker-wasm64/Dockerfile
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ff57c87
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docker-wasm64/Dockerfile
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+FROM emscripten/emsdk:6.0.5-arm64
+
+# Native stage0 needs the host libuv headers/library. The wasm stage builds its
+# own patched libuv through Emscripten.
+RUN apt-get update \
+ && DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
+      ccache \
+      libssl-dev \
+      libuv1-dev \
+      pkg-config \
+ && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
+
diff --git a/docker-wasm64/configure-qed64.sh b/docker-wasm64/configure-qed64.sh
new file mode 100755
index 0000000..5581ec3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docker-wasm64/configure-qed64.sh
@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+#!/bin/sh
+# QED64 clean-room configure: identical to configure.sh except
+#  * EMSCRIPTEN_MAXIMUM_MEMORY=17179869184 (16 GiB) — the certified runtime's
+#    declared maximum; an embedder may import any memory whose maximum is <=
+#    this, so 16 GiB keeps every worker configuration type-compatible;
+#  * CHECK_OLEAN_VERSION=OFF — this build embeds its real githash while the
+#    certified profile packs carry the original producer's; the patch series
+#    changes no serialization, and artifact trust lives in the SHA-256
+#    manifest layer, so the strict-equality githash gate must stay off.
+set -eu
+cmake /lean4 --preset release -B /build \
+  -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER_WORKS=1 \
+  -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=/emsdk/upstream/emscripten/cmake/Modules/Platform/Emscripten.cmake \
+  -DCMAKE_C_FLAGS=-m64 \
+  -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS=-m64 \
+  -DCMAKE_AR=/emsdk/upstream/emscripten/emar \
+  -DSTAGE0_CMAKE_C_COMPILER=/usr/bin/gcc \
+  -DSTAGE0_CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=/usr/bin/g++ \
+  -DSTAGE0_CMAKE_EXECUTABLE_SUFFIX= \
+  -DSTAGE0_USE_GMP=OFF \
+  -DSTAGE0_MMAP=OFF \
+  -DUSE_GMP=OFF \
+  -DMMAP=OFF \
+  -DUSE_MIMALLOC=OFF \
+  -DCHECK_OLEAN_VERSION=OFF \
+  -DLEAN_INSTALL_SUFFIX=-linux_wasm64 \
+  -DSTAGE1_LEAN_PLATFORM_TARGET=wasm64-unknown-emscripten \
+  -DEMSCRIPTEN_INITIAL_MEMORY=134217728 \
+  -DEMSCRIPTEN_MAXIMUM_MEMORY=17179869184
diff --git a/docker-wasm64/configure.sh b/docker-wasm64/configure.sh
new file mode 100755
index 0000000..ef5313e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docker-wasm64/configure.sh
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+#!/bin/sh
+set -eu
+
+cmake /lean4 --preset release -B /build \
+  -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER_WORKS=1 \
+  -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=/emsdk/upstream/emscripten/cmake/Modules/Platform/Emscripten.cmake \
+  -DCMAKE_C_FLAGS=-m64 \
+  -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS=-m64 \
+  -DCMAKE_AR=/emsdk/upstream/emscripten/emar \
+  -DSTAGE0_CMAKE_C_COMPILER=/usr/bin/gcc \
+  -DSTAGE0_CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=/usr/bin/g++ \
+  -DSTAGE0_CMAKE_EXECUTABLE_SUFFIX= \
+  -DSTAGE0_USE_GMP=OFF \
+  -DSTAGE0_MMAP=OFF \
+  -DUSE_GMP=OFF \
+  -DMMAP=OFF \
+  -DUSE_MIMALLOC=OFF \
+  -DCHECK_OLEAN_VERSION=ON \
+  -DLEAN_INSTALL_SUFFIX=-linux_wasm64 \
+  -DSTAGE1_LEAN_PLATFORM_TARGET=wasm64-unknown-emscripten \
+  -DEMSCRIPTEN_INITIAL_MEMORY=134217728 \
+  -DEMSCRIPTEN_MAXIMUM_MEMORY=12884901888
